      <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__user" dir="ltr">
    Gabrialla Grombridge
</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T12:55:34.000Z" aria-label="7 June 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >07/06/2019</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-7848">
    Lights off?
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



<!----></div>

              
</div>

          
    
              <div id="ember229238" class="small-valign-top l-column--equal-height l-column small-4 medium-6 large-4">
