  <span class="we-star-rating-stars-outlines">
    <span class="we-star-rating-stars we-star-rating-stars-5"></span>
  </span>
<!----></figure>


  <div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
      <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__user" dir="ltr">
    Taleigha Titchen
</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T03:13:37.000Z" aria-label="7 June 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >07/06/2019</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-7849">
    My Opinion of Houseparty
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I really like this app because I recently moved schools and I miss all of my friends and especially my best friends. And before I knew about this I wanted to talk to another friend but then someone else wanted to talk to me and FaceTime didn’t have that feature at that time so all of my friends told me to get it and I got it and it was nice because I finally got to talk to all of my best friends that I was missing sooooo much!!!! Although sometimes it would cause me and my friends to get in fights and it wasn’t fun. But other than that it has helped me and my close friends that were drifting apart come together even more!!!!</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



<!----></div>

              
</div>

          
    
