<!----></figure>


  <div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
      <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__user" dir="ltr">
    Tsuyuko Biglin
</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-06T11:17:05.000Z" aria-label="6 June 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >06/06/2019</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir id="we-customer-review-7850">
    Best
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I think this app is very cool. A huge struggle in youth culture is talking to friends all at once over the phone. This app solves the problem by creating a multiple people FaceTime system available for iPhones and Androids. This app also lets you use fun words such as “_____ is in the House” or “_______ wants to join” etc. This app is easy to use and functional while fun. All of my friends have it and it doesn’t go to waste. You should totally download this app, ASAP!!!</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



