7796366\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/ae/apps/6737796366?l=en-GB\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"9+\",\"value\":200,\"rank\":2,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Cartoon or Fantasy Violence\",\"Infrequent/Mild Contests\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/yalla-jackaroo/id6737796366\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":5,\"ratingCount\":21,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,1,20],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"5.0 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Board\",\"name\":\"Yalla Jackaroo\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"artistName\":\"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Welcome to Yalla Jackaroo! - The ORIGINAL Jackaroo Game!\\n\\nJump into the ORIGINAL Jackaroo experience where tradition meets modern fun! Play like a KING, chat with friends, and dominate the Jackaroo world. Yalla - let's game!\\n\\nWhy pick Yalla Jackaroo?\\nReal vibes: Feel the original feeling of offline games with real-time voice chat \u0026 interactive emojis!\\nMultiple Game Modes: Quick, 1v1, Crazy, Complex or Basic - Rich and fun game modes! Let you experience a different Jackaroo game in Yalla Jackaroo!\\nAmazing Rewards: Free coins, daily rewards, Pass rewards, and more—real gifts are waiting for you!\\nGlory Rankings: Exclusive Jackaroo honors just for you! Climb the Wealth Rank, XP Rank, and more! Earn medals and honors that show the world your true king-level skills.\\nExquisite Design: Every detail is carefully crafted to deliver a king-level visual experience.\\n\\nWhat Makes Us Special?\\nBeginner-Friendly: New to Jackaroo? Our tutorials make you a top player fast! Master king-level skills in no time!\\nLive Matching: Play Jackaroo with global players, chat while you play, double the fun in one game.\\nSocial Play: Team up with friends, create private rooms, and enjoy voice chat – perfect for online hangouts!\\n\\nParty\\nGrab your mic, join the conversation, and dive into lively chat! Show off your charm, meet new friends, and enjoy free real-time multiplayer voice chat! Ready to rule the chat? Be the King of Social!\\n\\n\\nDownload Yalla Jackaroo NOW!\\nYalla Jackaroo - The ORIGINAL game for KING-level fun! Begin your legendary journey! Play Like a King, we look forward to meeting you! \\n\\nContact Us:\\nEmail: jackaroo.support@yalla.com\\nFacebook \u0026 TikTok: Yalla Jackaroo - يلا جاكارو\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 metal \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.4 Update]\\n1. Daily Rewards revamp: new Treasure Hunt gameplay, come and challenge your eyesight!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-29T02:06:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.3.1 Update]\\n1. Added 1v1 mode, let's experience a more exciting Jackaroo game together!\\n2. Added XP Ranking, try to become the most experienced Jackaroo player.\\n3. Added Badge. Unlock and wear badges to show your strength.\\n4. Add more cool game effects, come and explore in the game!\\n5. Game experience optimization.\\n6. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-08T01:52:37Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.3 Update]\\n1. Combat Ranking: Record your brilliant moments of fierce struggle!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-23T08:55:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.3 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimize the Game Guide.\\n3. Optimize the experience of Pass.\\n4. bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-05T01:53:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.2 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimize the Game Guide.\\n3. Optimize the experience of Pass.\\n4. bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-03T01:42:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.1 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-22T02:13:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-21T05:35:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.1 Update]\\n1. Daily Tasks: Complete tasks to earn coins.\\n2. Level Rewards: Coins, diamonds, and skins are waiting for you.\\n3. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-26T07:43:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.0.1 Update]\\n\\n1. Chat Room: Talk and play with friends in real-time!\\n2. Quick Mode: Faster, more intense action!\\n3. VIP Rooms: Battle it out with the best players worldwide!\\n4. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-29T08:15:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.0 Update]\\n\\n1. Chat Room: Talk and play with friends in real-time!\\n2. Quick Mode: Faster, more intense action!\\n3. VIP Rooms: Battle it out with the best players worldwide!\\n4. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-25T01:41:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-27T15:07:38Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.yallajackaroo.com/\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6737796366\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=876396292\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"AED 0.00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"AED\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":208927744}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6737796366\u0026pricingPa