rack You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Contact Info\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Profanity or Crude Humour\",\"Infrequent/Mild Cartoon or Fantasy Violence\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"chartPositions\":{\"appStore\":{\"position\":188,\"genreName\":\"Entertainment\",\"genre\":6016,\"chart\":\"top-free\",\"genreShortName\":\"Entertainment\",\"chartLink\":\"https://apps.apple.com/ae/charts/iphone/entertainment-apps/6016\"}},\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/fadfadah-chat/id1659937451\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.4,\"ratingCount\":488,\"ratingCountList\":[37,9,30,37,375],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.4 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"3.0.2\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"name\":\"Fadfadah Chat\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"VioDev LLC\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.1 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 15.1 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.1 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 12.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Fadfadah Chat, allows you to meet new people and make conversations with them, you also can send a link to your friends friends to start a conversation with you, without revealing their identity.\\n\\nIt also allows you to frankly express your feelings and fears to others by using conversations, to talk to thousands of online users from around the world.\\n\\nReceive constructive criticism in an interactive and fun way.\\n\\nReveal what others think of you to improve your weaknesses and correct how you deal with them.\\n\\nDownload the app now, to enjoy all its features. you can do so using your email, facebook, apple, or twitter account.\\n\\nOur App Includes:\\n• Auto-renewable subscription\\n• 1 week, 1 month and 3 month durations\\n• Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (at the duration selected) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\\n• Current subscription may not be cancelled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your iTunes Account Settings after purchase\\n\\n• End User License Agreement Link:\\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isApp